cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Time-series-research-skills"
abstract: >-
  Agent Skills for time-series research: a stage-gated ideation compiler that turns a
  research urge into one traceable Idea Dossier with typed claims, evidence levels, and
  an explicit GO / PIVOT / NEED-EVIDENCE / KILL decision, plus a downstream skill that
  turns a frozen method into runnable, verified research code.
type: software
